Hi there! 

&amp;#x200B;

You have a great photographer gallery  with a clear niche. That's great. I've seen many big photography accounts with photos on par with the quality seen in yours.

&amp;#x200B;

From looking at your account here are several things I've noticed:

&amp;#x200B;

1) You use almost exactly the same hashtags in every post. Some of them like "Traverblogger" or "Indonesia" are HUGE hashtags and your photos are going to be buried within seconds from people also using that exact hashtag. You have no hope of making it ot the top 6 or 9 posts with that hashtag. Go small and aim for hashtags with fewer than 50k. Also, switch up your hashtags. 

&amp;#x200B;

2) Are you engaging with other accounts and commenting and liking other photos? You like the comments on your posts but that isn't enough. You should respond to every single comment you receive and return engagement. 

&amp;#x200B;

&amp;#x200B;
